  "instructions": [
    "Heat the ttukbaegi over medium heat and add olive oil, then sauté onion until translucent.",
    "Add garlic and paprika and cook for another minute until fragrant.",
    "Pour in the lentils, broth, and water, stirring to combine.",
    "Bring the mixture to a boil, then reduce heat to low, cover, and simmer for 30 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "Stir in the fig jam and cook for an additional 5 minutes to coat the lentils.",
    "Taste and season with salt and pepper, then remove from heat.",
    "Garnish with chopped parsley before serving.",
    "Serve hot straight from the ttukbaegi for a rustic presentation."
